-
-console.log(`Total: ${summary.totalAssignments}`);
-console.log(`Latency improvement: ${summary.metrics.latency.improvement}%`);
-console.log(`Significant: ${summary.metrics.latency.significant}`);
-```
-
-### Generating Test Data
-
-```typescript
